    "notes": "Three sessions at Bell Sound Studios, NYC. Jan 27: tracks 2, 3, 7 (plus bonus tracks 9-10). Feb 21: tracks 5, 6. Mar 13: tracks 1, 4, 8. The original 8-track LP was released Oct/Nov 1962 on Riverside RLP-433. CD reissues add bonus alternate takes."
